msgid "Post-course survey {#post-course-survey}"
msgstr "Encuesta posterior al curso {#post-course-survey}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Congratulations on completing this course! Please take a moment to help us "
"improve our course by filling out the following [quick "
"survey](https://your.feedback.ibm.com/jfe/form/SV_6S5Y3mnEAqGmM0m). Your "
"feedback will be used to enhance our content offering and user experience. "
"Thank you!\n"
msgstr ""
"> **Note:** This survey is provided by IBM Quantum and relates to the "
"original English content. To give feedback on doQumentation's website, "
"translations, or code execution, please [open a GitHub "
"issue](https://github.com/JanLahmann/doQumentation/issues).\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Test your knowledge {#test-your-knowledge}"
msgstr "Pon a prueba tus conocimientos {#test-your-knowledge}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"After completing the reading and activities in this course, click the button"
" below to navigate to IBM&reg; Training, where you can take the badging exam"
" for Quantum diagonalization algorithms.\n"
msgstr ""
"Después de completar la lectura y las actividades de este curso, haz clic en"
" el botón de abajo para ir a IBM&reg; Training, donde podrás realizar el "
"examen de la insignia de Algoritmos de Diagonalización Cuántica.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The exam consists of 20 questions, and you must answer at least 16 correctly"
" to pass. Upon receiving a passing score, your badge will automatically be "
"sent to the email you used to register with IBM&reg; Training.\n"
msgstr ""
"El examen consta de 20 preguntas, de las cuales debes responder "
"correctamente al menos 16 para aprobar. Si apruebas el examen, tu insignia "
"se enviará automáticamente a la dirección de correo electrónico con la que "
"te registraste en IBM&reg; Training.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Make sure you're ready to take the exam. If you don't receive a passing "
"score in two attempts, the exam becomes temporarily locked.\n"
msgstr ""
"Asegúrate de estar preparado/a para realizar el examen. Si no obtienes un "
"resultado suficiente en dos intentos, el examen se bloqueará "
"temporalmente.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Notice: These exams on the IBM Training site may be temporarily unavailable "
"in the next few days, due to maintenance.\n"
msgstr ""
"Nota: Estos exámenes en el sitio web de IBM Training podrían no estar "
"disponibles temporalmente en los próximos días debido a trabajos de "
"mantenimiento.\n"

